<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: AR">在每位教工交流的基础上，由考核小组评选推荐和党政办、教学处、德育处、教科室等职能处室评选推荐相结合，产生优秀候选人，最后由校党委会议讨论决定最终获得考核优秀的教工名单。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 28.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: AR">三、工作流程</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: ??_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: AR" lang=EN-US>1.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: ??_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: AR">个人总结。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: AR">每位教工下载《事业单位工作人员年度考核登记表》（见附件），完成个人总结。其中电子稿上传到校园网</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: ??_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: AR" lang=EN-US>-</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: AR">校办</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: ??_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: AR" lang=EN-US>-“2020</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: AR">年度事业单位考核</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: ??_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: AR" lang=EN-US>”</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: AR">公共文件夹各考核组文件夹内，</SPAN><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: red; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: AR">纸质稿正反面打印一式两份</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: AR">并交各组负责人。此项工作</SPAN><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: red; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: AR" lang=EN-US>1</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: red; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: AR">月<SPAN lang=EN-US>18</SPAN>日（周一）放学前</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: AR">完成。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: ??_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: AR" lang=EN-US>2.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: AR">分组交流推荐。要求每个教工都必须认真交流（见习期教师只交流，不考核），且交流时间不得少于</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: ??_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: AR" lang=EN-US>2</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: AR">分钟。分组交流具体时间与地点由学校确定（如遇特殊情况，负责人可另行确定交流时间地点）。各组负责人确定具体召开时间并通知联系领导参加，同时要求各组对照补充事项中的有关条件，通过书面投票方式推荐优秀（</SPAN><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: red; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: AR">按</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: red; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: ??_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: AR"> <SPAN lang=EN-US>24</SPAN></SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: red; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: AR">﹪比例四舍五入推荐</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: AR">）人选，其中优秀候选人须填写《绍兴一中<SPAN lang=EN-US>2020</SPAN>年度考核优秀候选人推荐表》，于</SPAN><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: red; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: AR" lang=EN-US>1</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: red; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: AR">月 <SPAN lang=EN-US>19 </SPAN>日（周二 ）放学前</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: AR">书面报送</SPAN><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: red; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: AR">党政办余栋材</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: AR">处。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: ??_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: ??_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: AR" lang=EN-US>3.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: ??_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: AR">条件审核。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: AR">党政办、教学处、德育处、教科室、总务处等有关部门对推荐名单按照条件进行审核。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: ??_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: AR" lang=EN-US>4.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: AR">审议确定。校党委会议根据推荐人选，并综合考虑学校各方面情况，审议决定考核结果，确定最终优秀人选名单。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
