<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: ??_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: AR" lang=EN-US>2.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: AR">教学业绩突出，所带班级学生在学校统一组织的大型考试中成绩优秀的教师，在特长生培养中成绩突出的教师，参加各类教学业务比赛获市直级一等奖及以上奖项的教师；</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
